{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_75_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_75","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_75_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_75","textTraditional":"十有二年春王三月庚午，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_75_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_75","textTraditional":"夏，楚人滅黃。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_75_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_75","textTraditional":"秋七月。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_75_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_75","textTraditional":"冬十有二月丁丑，陳侯杵臼卒。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_75_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_75","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_75_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_75","textTraditional":"十二年春，諸侯城衛楚丘之郛，懼狄難也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_75_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_75","textTraditional":"黃人恃諸侯之睦于齊也，不共楚職，曰：「自郢及我九百里，焉能害我？」夏，楚滅黃。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_75_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_75","textTraditional":"王以戎難故，討王子帶。秋，王子帶奔齊。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_75_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_75","textTraditional":"冬，齊侯使管夷吾平戎于王，使隰朋平戎于晉。王以上卿之禮饗管仲，管仲辭曰：「臣，賤有司也。有天子之二守國、高在，若節春秋來承王命，何以禮焉？陪臣敢辭。」王曰：「舅氏，余嘉乃勳，應乃懿德，謂督不忘。往踐乃職，無逆朕命。」管仲受下卿之禮而還。君子曰：「管子之世祀也宜哉！讓不忘其上。《詩》曰：『愷悌君子，神所勞矣。』」","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}